	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Wholly unable to concentrate on the scrolls before me, I once again think back to yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oooh, why in the world did I say all those embarrassing things?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Soujin-sama must be terribly disillusioned with me.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“'You're someone very precious to me...'”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"But then, why would he tell me ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"If I take his words at face value, it would have to mean that Soujin-sama considers me near and dear to his heart.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawawa!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I can feel the blood rush to my face.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"I never dared even imagine it before, but─",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"C-Could Soujin-sama see me as a woman?",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I may very well be misunderstanding him, but if there is even the slightest chance that he really feels this way...",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Just the thought of it sets my heart overflowing with joy.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah... I-I mustn't be thinking like this.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I cannot allow myself to get distracted.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"If he was never intimate with the Exalt-Priestesses of the past, then offering him my chastity holds no meaning either.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"It seems painfully obvious when put that way.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I should have at least confirmed that before making such an outrageous request of Soujin-sama.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"It is no wonder that he dismissed my advances as a mere impetuous indiscretion.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Ohh, why did I ever do such a thing...?",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Walking on air at the thought of being his bride, I completely forgot myself.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am such a dunderhead.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"What in the world was I even expecting?",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"To Soujin-sama, I will always be just one Exalt-Priestess among many.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I mustn't dwell on it any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"There are much more important matters to attend to.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Soujin-sama still has yet to reclaim Mitsurugi-sama's power.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"If we were to fight the Republican Army as we are now, we would face certain defeat.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I haven't a second to waste in finding a way to restore\nMitsurugi-sama's power.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Your Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyahh?!”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, just you, Isuzu...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I couldn't help but notice you were more preoccupied with talking to yourself than making headway with your research.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-When you become the Exalt-Priestess, you tend to have a lot more things on your mind.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I reply in a fluster, putting on airs to hide my embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“If you have any worries, you are more than welcome to discuss them with me.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It's not anything a little discussion will be able to solve.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh, what a shame. And here I was just wanting to lend my best friend an ear.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Urk...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"No fair.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Isuzu knows just the right words to pierce me right in the heart.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The last ritual was a failure, and I can't find any other ways to restore Mitsurugi-sama's power.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In the end, I wasn't able to be of any help at all.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Did you want advice, or just someone to whine to?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oooooohhh, you're always so mean to me!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I flop facefirst onto the pile of scrolls.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You would've done a way better job as Exalt-Priestess, Isuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why did I have to be chosen instead?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You shouldn't be saying such things.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You'll make all the priestesses serving under you anxious if they hear you putting yourself down like that.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I know. But maybe they're right to be...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"At the Imperial Seminary, Isuzu was always many times more accomplished than me.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I never once managed to outdo her, whether in scholastics or magicks.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"And yet, I was still chosen as Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You wanted to be Exalt-Priestess, too, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Everyone at the seminary thought that you'd be the one chosen.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Really now?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I mean, you took first place by a landslide in the 'Tento's Next Exalt-Priestess' survey I conducted in the dormitories.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You were that bored?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You know, you could've spent all that time studying instead.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well, you're not wrong...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Her straightforward admonition sinks my spirits even lower.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Weren't you disappointed when they picked me as Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I knew all along that you'd be the one chosen.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I look up at Isuzu's face for the first time.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I once approached your predecessor to inquire what qualities the Exalt-Priestess ought to possess.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Was it knowledge? Magicks? Strength of character, or perhaps a noble ancestry?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“What do you think Her Eminence's answer was?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Considering that I was chosen, was it ancestry?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaaaahhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You're suuuuuuuuuuuuuuuch an idiot.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You didn't have to stretch it out that long...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You think your beloved predecessor would seriously choose her successor for such a small-minded reason? Are we even talking about the same person?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"I apologize to Isuzu.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The gift to love unconditionally.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Her Eminence said the most important quality an Exalt-Priestess needs to possess is the gift to love unconditionally.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“As soon as I heard that, I knew that you'd be the next Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You're saying I have a gift to love unconditionally?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I find it hard to believe.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"And besides, what does “a gift to love unconditionally” even mean?",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You do. That's why you were chosen.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“And so, even if your scholastics and magicks aren't even worth mentioning, you should still keep your chin up.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not even worth mentioning?!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I was usually in the top half of the class, I'll have you know!",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Well, for someone like Isuzu who was never not first, I suppose that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"would",
{"/font"},
" qualify as not even worth mentioning.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Just remember─if you don't put in the effort, it'll be proof that your predecessor had a bad eye for character.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It's all up to you to defend her honor.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Isuzu has never been one to sugarcoat things, but her encouragement never fails to lift my spirits.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Okay. I'll keep it in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The two of us decide to make a tour of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“...It's as I feared. Many of these wards are in tatters.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Inner Iseya is concealed and protected by spellwards which emanate from magicks within the sacred stones scattered across its perimeter.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Isuzu doesn't allow even the slightest blemish to escape her sight.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I've repaired the damage. Let's proceed to the next one.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Isuzu quickly finishes her work before moving on.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I offer to help with the repairs, but Isuzu turns me down, even threatening to tell on me to Akari-sama.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"And so, I'm reduced to following Isuzu around, no more useful than a fledgling apprentice.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are magicks really even such a good thing?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“They are convenient and all, but at the same time, they give rise to distortions.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Magicks have the power to work miracles and make possible the impossible.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The Empire's entire foundation is built upon this edifice.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"But even still...",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“What are you even talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Isuzu lets out an exasperated sigh.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The foundation of magicks is nothing more than an earnest entreaty to Oomikami, a veneration of His divinity with offerings and prayer.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“And in His benevolence, He bequeaths us the boon of miracle to reshape the world to our will.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Of course I know that.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But still, doesn't it make you a bit uneasy?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We tamper with the world's natural order for our own convenience, only to turn around and pretend the distortions never existed.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“When magicks were still primeval, only a few favored priestesses could deliver their prayers to Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Hence, in the time of the Founding Empress, there was only a scarce handful of priestesses to be found.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
{"font", size=41},
"“And so the Founding Empress, in all her infinite compassion for the people, remade the system of magicks such that any priestess could perform miracles─Wait, why am I lecturing the Exalt-Priestess of all people on this?”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Indeed, this history is common knowledge to all priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"And it is an incontrovertible fact that as the number of priestesses swelled, the Empire prospered.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“To shepherd those who are lost, to save those who are suffering, and to serve all those who inhabit these lands, we willingly offer Oomikami our entire being.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“That is our vow as priestesses. That is our purpose.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You don't have to remind me. They repeated it so often at the seminary that my ears are still ringing.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"That was always the answer we were given as to why priestesses are needed.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"But is this necessarily true?",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Rather than our piety or our devotion, isn't it simply our magicks that we are needed for?",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, will my worries never cease?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“That is part and parcel of the Exalt-Priestess's station. The Imperial people deserve no less.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Isuzu lightly pats me on the shoulder to cheer me up.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
		next152={ block=15, label=2 },
		exit152={ block=26, label=1 },
	},
}
